---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import Details from '../components/Details.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
import { guides } from '../data/guides';
import heroImg from '../assets/coast-hero.jpg';
import portrait from '../assets/shloka-portrait.jpg';
import guideImg from '../assets/coast-strip.jpg';

const posts = (await getCollection('blog')).sort((a, b) => b.data.date.valueOf() - a.data.date.valueOf()).slice(0, 3);
const guide = guides[0];
---
<Base
  title="Therapy for First-Gen and Immigrant Adults in California | Shloka Iyer, LMFT"
  description="South Asian therapist Shloka Iyer, LMFT offers online therapy across California for immigrants, first-gen and high-functioning adults facing anxiety and identity questions."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero__media">
      <Image src={heroImg} alt="" widths={[640, 960, 1400]} sizes="(max-width: 820px) 100vw, 66vw" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" quality={70} />
    </div>
    <div class="wrap hero__inner">
      <div class="hero__text">
        <p class="eyebrow">South Asian therapist · Online across California</p>
        <h1>Therapy for immigrants, first-generation adults, and individuals navigating identity and relationships.</h1>
        <hr class="rule" />
        <p class="hero__sub">A space to understand yourself in context, heal relational patterns, and move forward with greater clarity and self-trust.</p>
        <div class="hero__cta">
          <a class="btn" href="/contact">Schedule a Consultation Call</a>
          <span class="hero__note">Free 15-minute call</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-label="What therapy can help with">
    <div class="wrap">
      <ul class="features">
        <li class="feature">
          <Icon name="leaf" />
          <div>
            <h3>Understand yourself in context</h3>
            <p>Explore how your background, relationships, and experiences shape who you are.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="feature">
          <Icon name="wave" />
          <div>
            <h3>Heal relational patterns</h3>
            <p>Build healthier ways of relating to yourself and others.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="feature">
          <Icon name="sun" />
          <div>
            <h3>Navigate life transitions</h3>
            <p>Find support through uncertainty, change, and new beginnings.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="feature">
          <Icon name="compass" />
          <div>
            <h3>Move forward with intention</h3>
            <p>Cultivate clarity, boundaries, and a life that feels aligned.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--white section--line">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div class="split__media split__media--portrait">
        <Image src={portrait} alt="Shloka Iyer, LMFT, a South Asian therapist based in San Francisco" widths={[400, 640, 900]} sizes="(max-width: 820px) 22rem, 40vw" quality={75} />
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p class="eyebrow">A little about me</p>
        <h2>I'm Shloka.</h2>
        <hr class="rule" />
        <p>
          I'm a Licensed Marriage and Family Therapist based in San Francisco, CA. I help thoughtful, ambitious individuals who are carrying a lot on the inside, often in silence, feel more connected, grounded, and at home in themselves and their relationships.
        </p>
        <p>
          As a South Asian therapist, I bring a nuanced understanding of cultural identity, migration, and the unique pressures faced by immigrants and first-generation individuals. I know what it's like to straddle different worlds while trying to maintain your authentic self.
        </p>
        <p>
          Many of the people I work with look fine on the outside but feel anxious, burnt out, or uncertain about their direction internally.
        </p>
        <p><a class="arrow-link" href="/about">Read more about me</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--line">
    <div class="wrap cols">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">In session</p>
        <h2>What we might work on</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Therapy is not about quickly fixing what feels difficult. Instead, our work may involve:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Understanding patterns that keep you feeling stuck or avoidant</li>
          <li>Developing language for emotions that have been hard to articulate</li>
          <li>Navigating relationships with more clarity and directness</li>
          <li>Examining expectations around identity, gender roles, and responsibility</li>
          <li>Making decisions that reflect who you are now</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Many clients begin therapy feeling disconnected or uncertain. Over time, they often become more comfortable examining their experiences rather than avoiding them.</p>
        <p><a class="arrow-link" href="/who-i-work-with">Who I work with</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--white section--line" aria-labelledby="details-heading">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Practical details</p>
          <h2 id="details-heading">Fees, insurance and how sessions work</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="arrow-link" href="/faq">All questions answered</a>
      </div>
      <Details />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--line" aria-labelledby="guides-heading">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Guides</p>
          <h2 id="guides-heading">Making therapy feel a little less unfamiliar</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="arrow-link" href="/guides">Browse all guides</a>
      </div>
      <div class="guide-feature">
        <div class="guide-feature__media">
          <Image src={guideImg} alt="" widths={[600, 900]} sizes="(max-width: 820px) 100vw, 45vw" quality={70} />
          <div class="guide-feature__label">
            <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--taupe">Guide {guide.number}</p>
            <h3>{guide.title}</h3>
            <p>{guide.summary}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="guide-feature__body">
          <ul class="icon-list">
            <li><Icon name="chat" /><div><h3>The First Session</h3><p>What to expect in our initial conversation.</p></div></li>
            <li><Icon name="wave" /><div><h3>After the Intake</h3><p>How therapy unfolds over time.</p></div></li>
            <li><Icon name="leaf" /><div><h3>My Style</h3><p>How I work and what guides my approach.</p></div></li>
            <li><Icon name="sun" /><div><h3>The Therapeutic Relationship</h3><p>Why our relationship is an important part of the work.</p></div></li>
          </ul>
          <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a class="arrow-link" href={`/guides/${guide.slug}`}>Read the guide</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--white section--line" aria-labelledby="writing-heading">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 id="writing-heading">Recent Writing</h2>
        <a class="arrow-link" href="/blog">View all essays</a>
      </div>
      <ul class={`cards ${posts.length === 2 ? 'cards--two' : ''}`}>
        {posts.map((post) => (
          <li class="card">
            <div class="card__media">
              <Image src={post.data.cover} alt="" widths={[480, 800]} sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 40vw" quality={70} />
            </div>
            <div class="card__body">
              <h3><a href={`/blog/${post.id}`}>{post.data.title}</a></h3>
              <p>{post.data.excerpt}</p>
              <span class="card__more" aria-hidden="true">Read more →</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand />
</Base>
